Careful: as shown, that Caddyfile has lost its opening { and its import line. It will not validate, and if it were reloaded every site would go, the relay included. Do not reload it like this.

The whole file should read:

{
	on_demand_tls {
		ask http://127.0.0.1:65430/face/allowed
	}
}

import sites/*.caddy

Then: caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile --adapter caddyfile; when it says Valid, systemctl reload caddy, and ./bash/face-setup again.

